	(text "The ESP32-PICO-D4 with its supply decoupling, the antenna's matching network, the antenna and the IPEX\nconnector, the I2C pull-ups; the USB-C receptacle, the CP2104 USB to UART bridge and the auto-reset\ntransistors on EN and GPIO0.\n\nMain parts: U1 ESP32-PICO-D4, L1 C4 C6, ANT1, ANT2 IPEX, R26 R27, J2 USB-C, U2 CP2104-F03-GMR, Q2 Q3 S8050,\nD7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 48.26 0)
