	(text "The e-paper panel's 24-pin connector with its capacitors and the booster that makes its gate supplies VGG\nand VEE; the M5-Bus socket, the FPC to the HAT board, the Grove port, and the ESD arrays and 47R series\nresistors between the ESP32 and the M5-Bus.\n\nMain parts: EPD1, L4, Q6 CJ2310, D15-D17, BUS1 M5-Bus, J1 FPC to HAT, J3 Grove, D1-D3 SRV05-4, R6-R16, R48\nR49"
